---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro'
---
<Layout title="About | Jingwen Zheng" description="About Jingwen Zheng, master's student in computer technology and computer architecture researcher.">
  <section class="page-head">
    <span class="eyebrow">About / Beyond the research</span>
    <h1 class="section-title mt-5">Curiosity, systems, and <span class="text-gradient">continuous learning.</span></h1>
    <p class="section-desc mt-6 text-lg">I'm Jingwen Zheng, a master's student in Computer Technology with research interests in computer architecture, memory-centric acceleration, and reliable computing.</p>
  </section>
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[1.7fr_1fr] gap-12 py-15">
    <div class="space-y-6 leading-8 text-base-content/75">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-base-content">A little about me</h2>
      <p>My current work revolves around questions at the intersection of hardware and software: how to move less data, make better use of memory bandwidth, and reason about reliability across execution layers.</p>
      <p>Through <strong class="text-base-content">ArchEcho</strong>, I collect paper notes, architecture insights, and reflections from my research journey. Writing helps me turn scattered ideas into a connected understanding.</p>
      <p>My academic background and more detailed CV will be added once the information is ready for public display.</p>
    </div>
    <aside class="soft-card h-fit">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-lg">At a glance</h3>
      <dl class="mt-6 space-y-5">
        <div><dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-base-content/45">Current</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-semibold">Master's Student</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-base-content/45">Field</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-semibold">Computer Architecture</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-base-content/45">Interests</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-semibold">LLM · PIM · Reliability</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <a class="link-arrow inline-block mt-8" href="https://github.com/ImWen-97">Connect on GitHub →</a>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Layout>
